      "writtenOn": "2026-06-10T05:28:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is trying to fix a case that a user uploads a cert-only file without having generated a CSR first, so no privkey.pem was ever stored.\n\nThat doesn\u0027t fit `InternalFailure`. Nothing internal has broken, the BMC is in a valid state, and this is an out-of-sequence but legitimate user action, a precondition the user can fix rather than a software fault.\n\nDoes it make sense? We can pick up another sdbus error instead of `InvalidCertificateError`.",
