      "writtenOn": "2026-06-10T03:52:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is mixing responsibilities.\n\ncheckAndAppendPrivateKey() is now doing key lookup, validation, and file\nmutation. These are install-time decisions and should be handled in the\ninstall flow, not inside a helper.\n\nWe already have install() coordinating:\n- appendKeyMap\n- compareKeys()\n\nAdding validation here breaks that separation and spreads the logic across\nmultiple places, making the flow harder to follow.\n\ncheckAndAppendPrivateKey() should remain a simple helper (append-only),\nand validation should stay in the install path.",
